    },
    "Fixed expenses, such as rent, utilities, and subscriptions, are consistent costs you can anticipate each month. Properly accounting for these necessary outflows ensures you maintain financial stability and can plan effectively for savings and discretionary spending." : {

    },
    "Flexible Expenses" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : " Переменные расходы"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flexible expenses, such as shopping, coffee, and food delivery, can vary greatly from month to month and are often allocated as a percentage of your budget. By keeping these variable costs in check, you can better manage your overall finances and allocate more funds towards savings and essential expenses." : {

